# Currency rules, French. Same format as the English file (see there); the code list is shared in spirit and repeated for the language.
#
# [currency.symbol]: form | ISO 4217 code | prefix, suffix or both | confidence (optional).
# [currency.name]:   forms, comma-separated | ISO 4217 code | value of one in the currency (optional) | confidence (optional).
# The French form of a name after "de" is written with the elided preposition: "d'euros" (the apostrophe may be straight or curly).

[currency.symbol]
$ | USD | both | 0.9
US$ | USD | prefix
A$ | AUD | prefix
C$ | CAD | prefix
CA$ | CAD | prefix
€ | EUR | both
£ | GBP | both
¥ | JPY | both | 0.7
￥ | JPY | both | 0.7
₹ | INR | both
₩ | KRW | both
₽ | RUB | both
₺ | TRY | both
₪ | ILS | both

[currency.name]
euro, euros, d'euros, d'euro | EUR | 1 | 0.95
centime, centimes | EUR | 0.01 | 0.7
eurocent, eurocents | EUR | 0.01
dollar, dollars, de dollars, dollar américain, dollars américains, dollar us, dollars us | USD | 1 | 0.9
dollar canadien, dollars canadiens | CAD
dollar australien, dollars australiens | AUD
dollar néo-zélandais, dollars néo-zélandais | NZD
franc suisse, francs suisses, de francs suisses | CHF
livre sterling, livres sterling, de livres sterling | GBP
penny, pence | GBP | 0.01 | 0.7
yen, yens | JPY
yuan, yuans, renminbi | CNY
roupie, roupies | INR
rouble, roubles | RUB
won, wons | KRW
peso mexicain, pesos mexicains | MXN
